    "group": "Sentry Pylon",
    "summary": "Once per battle, as your opponent's turn ends, if no enemy unit is in this **FORTIFICATION**'s **Engagement Range**, you can take it off the battlefield. If you do:\n\n- set it back up in [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase)'s Reinforcements step, more than 8\" horizontally from every enemy model\n- it is **destroyed** if the battle ends while it is off the battlefield",
